<title>CANADA: Tee-Comm says bank appoints receiver.</title>
<headline>Tee-Comm says bank appoints receiver.</headline>
<dateline>MILTON, Ontario 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tee-Comm Electronics Inc said on Thursday the Bank of Montreal, its existing lender, had on Wednesday demanded immediate repayment of its credit facility.</p>
<p>It said the bank had appointed an interim receiver in respect of the property and assets of the company and some of its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>In addition, the board of directors resigned effective May 21, 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
